        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Electoral district of Fisher, Adelaide, Aberfoyle Park, Chandlers Hill, Cherry Gardens, Coromandel East, Happy Valley, Reynella East, Clarendon, O'Halloran Hill, Woodcroft\n- Organizations: City of Onkaparinga\n- Topics: South Australian geography, electoral boundaries\n\nFacts:\n- The Electoral district of Fisher covers a 94.2 km² suburban and semi-rural area on the southern fringes of Adelaide.\n- The Electoral district of Fisher includes Aberfoyle Park, Chandlers Hill, Cherry Gardens, Coromandel East, Happy Valley, Reynella East, and parts of Clarendon, O'Halloran Hill, and Woodcroft.\n- Aberfoyle Park is a suburb in the City of Onkaparinga in South Australia.",
